                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/1272: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Paraguay</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Horn</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                            Acting Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Asunción</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-07-05T10:00:00-03:50">July 5, 1931—10
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received July 6—12:32 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>70. Bolivian Minister and Secretary of Legation left Asuncion this morning.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Horn</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
